lokihouse (0.11.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Schema version 3: run lokihouse -schema.migrate once (all instances
    stopped) after upgrading; it only adds columns and indexes to logs,
    no data copy.
  * Query path: stream-ID sets of any size, time-windowed reads, Tier A
    aggregation pushdown, structured-metadata and parsed label-filter
    pushdown (see CHANGELOG.md).

